<title>UK: Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt set warrants on the DAX index.</title>
<headline>Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt set warrants on the DAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt said it had issued a total of 180 million American-style call and put warrants, in 18 equal tranches, on the DAX index.</p>
<p>100 warrants control one index. There are seven tranches of call warrants and 11 tranches of put warrants. All have diffeent maturity dates.</p>
<p>They are listed Berlin, Duesseldorf, Frankfurt, Hamburg and Stuttgart. The pay date is September 27, 1996.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
